sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant CLI as CLI App
    participant Service as ExpenseService
    participant DB as SQLite Database
    User->>CLI: Choose Add Expense
    CLI->>CLI: Validate input
    CLI->>Service: add_expense(data)
    Service->>DB: INSERT expense
    DB-->>Service: New ID
    Service-->>CLI: Expense ID
    CLI-->>User: Show success message